    "index": 1,
    "title": "A Database With a Standby",
    "from": "Daniel, enterprise customer",
    "brief": "We're signing a contract that requires 99.9% availability. Our auditors found that your database is a single machine: if it dies, everything stops for twenty minutes. Fix that before Monday. We're told it will be tested.",
